# Aggressive variant: any client event may appear in either gap,
# including CONNECT (session restart mid-flow) and DISCONNECT (early teardown).
# Total session bounded to 30 s.

<CONNECT.PUBLISH.<(CONNECT+PUBLISH+PUBREL+PINGREQ+DISCONNECT)*>_[0,10].PUBREL.<(CONNECT+PUBLISH+PUBREL+PINGREQ+DISCONNECT)*>_[0,10].DISCONNECT>_[0,30]
